with her friends.

7
00:01:26,687 --> 00:01:28,655
Hello.

8
00:01:28,756 --> 00:01:30,986
Come on over and meet
my friends, Hoppers.

9
00:01:31,092 --> 00:01:36,428
She would throw the most amazing tea
parties for her very closest companions.

10
00:01:36,530 --> 00:01:40,159
Mr. Elephant, have you met my daddy?
